{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Personalized wellness coaching for sustainable habits, clarity, and calm. Guided frameworks, bite-sized practices, measurable outcomes." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body class="site">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap header-row">
      <div class="brand">
        <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" stroke="#2b2b2b" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/></svg>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <small>{{TAGLINE}}</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Paths</a>
        <a href="services.html">Work With Me</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta">Book</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="toggle navigation" id="navToggle">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="decorative organic shapes" class="hero-graphic" />
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Small habits. Clear structure. Lasting change.</h1>
          <p class="lead">I help busy people build a simple daily system that shifts energy, focus, and resilience — without willpower drama.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="#programs">Explore Programs</a>
          </div>
          <form class="lead-magnet" id="leadForm">
            <label for="emailInput">Free guide: 5-day Habit Reset</label>
            <div class="form-row">
              <input id="emailInput" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />
              <button type="submit" class="btn small">Get the guide</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story wrap" id="about">
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="avatar">
          <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="photo placeholder" />
        </div>
        <div class="story-copy">
          <h2>Where this work started</h2>
          <p>Hi — I’m {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. I spent years untangling scattered routines and burned-out energy, then built a concise, human-first framework that scales. My approach centers on small wins, clear cues, and weekly rhythm — so change feels doable and sticks.</p>
          <p class="muted">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Remote coaching worldwide</p>
          <a class="btn" href="about.html">Learn my story</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework" id="framework">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>My coaching framework</h2>
        <p class="lead">A three-band approach: clarity, routine, and adaptation. No gimmicks — just repeatable practices you can build on.</p>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>1. Clarify</h3>
            <p>Get a realistic map of priorities and energy. We translate goals into daily behaviors that make sense for your life.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>2. Install</h3>
            <p>We design tiny, daily practices and cue-based rituals so momentum grows without friction.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>3. Tune</h3>
            <p>Weekly reflections and micro-adjustments keep your system aligned as demands shift.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="muted">Each element feeds into practical habits — measurable, repeatable, and built around your life.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="programs wrap" id="programs">
      <h2>Programs — focused pathways</h2>
      <p class="lead">Choose a guided path based on your starting point and desired cadence.</p>
      <div class="program-grid">
        <article class="program">
          <h3>Springboard — 8-week Foundations</h3>
          <p>For people launching a new routine. Weekly coaching, daily micro-practices, habit tracker template.</p>
          <a class="link" href="programs.html">Details</a>
        </article>
        <article class="program">
          <h3>Habit Alchemy — 12-week Deepen</h3>
          <p>For those who need momentum. Bi-weekly coaching, habit stacking, and compounding rituals for energy and focus.</p>
          <a class="link" href="programs.html">Details</a>
        </article>
        <article class="program">
          <h3>Sustained Vitality — Ongoing Support</h3>
          <p>Monthly maintenance for long-term results: check-ins, adjustments, and accountability that fits your calendar.</p>
          <a class="link" href="programs.html">Details</a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="program-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="programs.html">See full curriculum</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing-summary wrap" id="pricing">
      <h2>Pricing & commitments</h2>
      <p class="lead">Straightforward tiers crafted around outcomes and time commitments — transparent and flexible.</p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Launch — 8 weeks</h3>
          <p class="price">$950</p>
          <p>Weekly coaching, habit toolkit, email support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Deepen — 12 weeks</h3>
          <p class="price">$1,800</p>
          <p>Bi-weekly sessions, personalized plans, behavior lab.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Maintain — monthly</h3>
          <p class="price">$220 / month</p>
          <p>Monthly check-ins, adjustments, priority messaging.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">Need a custom plan? <a href="contact.html">Contact me</a> for team or corporate options.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials wrap" id="testimonials">
      <h2>What clients say</h2>
      <div class="testimonials-grid">
        <blockquote>
          "I finally have a simple morning rhythm that actually sticks. My days are quieter and more productive." — Lauren, designer
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "Small shifts created big wins. I feel less reactive and more in control of my energy." — Marco, engineer
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "The weekly check-ins are the secret sauce — accountability without pressure." — Priya, entrepreneur
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="testimonials.html">More stories</a>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta wrap">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h2>Ready to build your system?</h2>
        <p>Start with a complimentary clarity call. We'll map one practical change you can execute this week.</p>
        <a class="btn primary" href="book.html">Schedule a clarity call</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Ask a question</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer wrap">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <small>{{TAGLINE}}</small>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Phone: {{PHONE}}</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="copyright">© {{COACH_NAME}} — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
